## Color

Color tokens are dark-mode native. Light mode is deferred until post-Pilot.

### Primary

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `color.primary.orange` | `#E87A1D` | Primary brand accent, CTAs in marketing context |
| `color.primary.green` | `#3D9B2F` | Primary action, success-leaning |
| `color.primary.greenLogo` | `#47E7B0` | Logo-only green (per commit `63419cb`) — **reconcile** |
| `color.primary.accent` | `#00D278` | Highlight, success state, decision-engine verdict positive |

### Background

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `color.bg.base` | `#0A0A0F` | Root window |
| `color.bg.surface` | `#111118` | Cards, sheets |
| `color.bg.elevated` | `#1A1A24` | Modals, popovers, raised cards |
| `color.bg.border` | `#2A2A3A` | Dividers, card borders |

